#
# Encoding scope: one MACE model per material, fine-tuned from the
# MACE-OMAT foundation model on 150-260 PBE-D3 configurations selected
# with SOAP from MACE-OMAT MD of twisted bilayers (21.79 deg down to
# about 3.15 deg) plus high-symmetry stackings, with the stated energy
# and force RMSEs. Interlayer distances, stacking energies, strain fields
# and phonons are properties.

